chinesesimplified.ErrUpiaVerify=无法确认安装结果。请重新启动 Photoshop，并检查“插件”菜单中是否有 AstMatrix。
english.ErrUpiaStopped=Installation did not finish. Try again.
chinesesimplified.ErrUpiaStopped=安装未完成。请重试。
english.ErrManagedConflict=AstMatrix is already installed. Uninstall it through Creative Cloud and try again.
chinesesimplified.ErrManagedConflict=已安装 AstMatrix。请通过 Creative Cloud 卸载后重试。
