chinesesimplified.ErrManagedIdentity=请通过 Creative Cloud 卸载 AstMatrix。
english.ErrUpiaMissing=Repair Creative Cloud, then try again.
chinesesimplified.ErrUpiaMissing=请修复 Creative Cloud 后重试。
english.ErrUpiaAmbiguous=Uninstall AstMatrix for Photoshop through Creative Cloud.
chinesesimplified.ErrUpiaAmbiguous=请通过 Creative Cloud 卸载 AstMatrix for Photoshop。
english.ErrUpiaRemoval=Unable to uninstall AstMatrix. Try again or uninstall it through Creative Cloud.
chinesesimplified.ErrUpiaRemoval=无法卸载 AstMatrix。请重试，或通过 Creative Cloud 卸载。
english.ErrUpiaRemovalVerify=Unable to confirm removal. Open Creative Cloud to check whether AstMatrix is still installed.
chinesesimplified.ErrUpiaRemovalVerify=无法确认卸载结果。请在 Creative Cloud 中检查 AstMatrix 是否已卸载。
english.ErrInstallerBusy=Another AstMatrix installer is running. Wait for it to finish and try again.
chinesesimplified.ErrInstallerBusy=另一个 AstMatrix 安装程序正在运行。请等待其完成后重试。
english.ErrInvalidOption=The option to disable CEP developer mode is only available when uninstalling AstMatrix for Illustrator.
chinesesimplified.ErrInvalidOption=关闭 CEP 开发者模式的选项仅适用于卸载 AstMatrix for Illustrator。
english.ErrDowngrade=A newer version of AstMatrix is already installed.
chinesesimplified.ErrDowngrade=已安装更高版本的 AstMatrix。
